diode: a diode (sp_diode, SPICE level 1) behind a resistor, its forward curve swept by the source
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
load "spice/diode.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
model dmod sp_diode is=1e-14 n=1.05 rs=10.0
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=0.0
r1 (in a) resistor r=1k
d1 (a 0) dmod
control
  sweep s1 instance="v1" parameter="dc" from=0.0 to=2.0 step=0.1
  analysis dc1 op
endc
